  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nikhalamo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">Nikhalamo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Mozambique):  The main focus of Nikhalamo is to provide education opportunities for orphaned and vulnerable adolescent girls in Namacurra and to reduce obstacles that impede the enrollment, retention and transition to secondary school for girls in upper primary school. With FY 2017 Water, Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH) funds, Nikhalamo will provide construction of latrines, support awareness and behavior change intervention related to WASH, and will promote the adoption of healthy behaviors with respect to water, sanitation, and hygiene practices. Nikhalamo will create WASH committees, clubs, and awareness raising campaigns; construct and maintain hand washing stations; install water storage facilities; and support latrine usage and upkeep and proper waste disposal. The activity will provide training on sanitation practices to community workers and will also focus on menstrual hygiene management to allow young girls to stay in school during their menstrual cycle.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="PT">(Mo&#xe7;ambique): O foco principal de Nikhalamo &#xe9; proporcionar oportunidades de educa&#xe7;&#xe3;o para raparigas adolescentes &#xf3;rf&#xe3;s e vulner&#xe1;veis &#x200b;&#x200b;em Namacurra e reduzir os obst&#xe1;culos que impedem a matr&#xed;cula, reten&#xe7;&#xe3;o e transi&#xe7;&#xe3;o para o ensino secund&#xe1;rio para raparigas no ensino prim&#xe1;rio. Com os fundos do ano fiscal de 2017 para &#xc1;gua, Saneamento e Higiene (WASH), Nikhalamo ir&#xe1; fornecer a constru&#xe7;&#xe3;o de latrinas, apoiar interven&#xe7;&#xf5;es de sensibiliza&#xe7;&#xe3;o e mudan&#xe7;a de comportamento relacionadas com WASH e promover&#xe1; a adop&#xe7;&#xe3;o de comportamentos saud&#xe1;veis &#x200b;&#x200b;no que diz respeito &#xe0; &#xe1;gua, saneamento e pr&#xe1;ticas de higiene. Nikhalamo criar&#xe1; comit&#xe9;s, clubes e campanhas de sensibiliza&#xe7;&#xe3;o WASH; construir e manter esta&#xe7;&#xf5;es de lavagem de m&#xe3;os; instalar instala&#xe7;&#xf5;es de armazenamento de &#xe1;gua; e apoiar a utiliza&#xe7;&#xe3;o e manuten&#xe7;&#xe3;o de latrinas e a elimina&#xe7;&#xe3;o adequada de res&#xed;duos. A actividade proporcionar&#xe1; forma&#xe7;&#xe3;o em pr&#xe1;ticas de saneamento aos trabalhadores comunit&#xe1;rios e tamb&#xe9;m se concentrar&#xe1; na gest&#xe3;o da higiene menstrual para permitir que as jovens permane&#xe7;am na escola durante o seu ciclo menstrual.</narrative>
  </description>
